  <metadata>
    <name>Kehrsatz side–Ulmiz exact — continuous section</name>
    <desc>Continuous, gap-free section starting near Kehrsatz and following the uploaded Gurten/Ulmizer route through the exact uploaded Ulmiz Trail and Plattenweg connector to the original route endpoint. No artificial connector is included.</desc>
    <link href="https://www.trailforks.com/route/gurten-ulmizer/">
      <text>Base Trailforks route</text>
    </link>
    <link href="https://www.trailforks.com/trails/ulmiz-trail/">
      <text>Ulmiz Trail</text>
    </link>
    <link href="https://www.trailforks.com/trails/plattenweg-connector/">
      <text>Plattenweg connector</text>
    </link>
  </metadata>
